{"query":"Search for primary randomized trials or cohort studies reporting independent original data on untreated bed net effectiveness and harms, not reviews or news summaries.","results":[{"position":1,"site_name":"pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov","snippet":"Incorporating information from 22 randomized controlled trials (RCTs), the review found that ITNs reduced child mortality by 17%.","title":"Insecticide‐treated nets for preventing malaria - PMC - NIH","url":"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC6418392/"},{"position":2,"site_name":"www.givewell.org","snippet":"We estimate that sleeping under nets reduces malaria mortality by around 40% to 55% This is based on a meta-analysis of randomized controlled trials (RCTs), ...","title":"Mass Distribution of Insecticide-Treated Nets (ITNs) - GiveWell","url":"https://www.givewell.org/international/technical/programs/insecticide-treated-nets"},{"position":3,"site_name":"www.cdc.gov","snippet":"In community-wide trials in several African settings, ITNs reduced the death of children under 5 years from all causes by about 20%.","title":"Insecticide-Treated Nets | Malaria - CDC","url":"https://www.cdc.gov/malaria/php/public-health-strategy/insecticide-treated-nets.html"},{"position":4,"site_name":"www.medrxiv.org","snippet":"Results suggest that participants do not always consider ITNs to be effective or considered other preventive methods to be more effective.","title":"Reasons for mosquito net non-use in malaria-endemic countries","url":"https://www.medrxiv.org/content/10.1101/2023.05.16.23290037v1.full-text"},{"position":5,"site_name":"www.lshtm.ac.uk","snippet":"The two-year community randomised trial involved more than 39,000 households and followed over 4,500 children aged 6 months to 14 years in ...","title":"No flight, no bite - 'Mosquito grounding' bed net nearly halves ...","url":"https://www.lshtm.ac.uk/newsevents/news/2022/no-flight-no-bite-mosquito-grounding-bed-net-nearly-halves-malaria-infection"},{"position":6,"site_